ed template arguments are present before job submission\n3. **Assign an owner** \u2014 incident is currently unassigned; a DRI from NewDC/NewRegion or FRP should own follow-up\n4. **Confirm skip behavior** with the customer \u2014 review whether skipping these tasks in \u0060cosmosDb_newRegion_manifestValidation_manifestCheckin\u0060 is intentional or if they need to run\n5. **Add pre-flight validation** in RemoteJobProviderV2 to detect missing template arguments or invalid environment values before job execution begins\n\n---\n\n**Saved to:** \u0060E:\\icms\\Azure_Capacity_Infrastructure_Service\\NewDC_NewRegion\\752886997\\\u0060","ai.success":true,"ai.model":"claude-sonnet-4.6","ai.durationMs":74000,"ai.inputTokens":267534,"ai.outputTokens":2103,"incidentFolder":"E:\\icms\\Azure_Capacity_Infrastructure_Service\\NewDC_NewRegion\\752886997\\"},"outputData":{"incidentFolder":"E:\\icms\\Azure_Capacity_Infrastructure_Service\\NewDC_NewRegion\\752886997\\"},"globalVariables":{"body.timestamp":"2026-04-30T22:45:14.965Z","codeIssueFile":"","agentFolder":"E:\\work\\hub\\docs\\wiki","__webhookBody":"{\n  \u0022incidentId\u0022: 752886997,\n  \u0022serviceName\u0022: \u0022\u0022,\n  \u0022teamName\u0022: \u0022\u0022,\n  \u0022timestamp\u0022: \u00222026-04-30T22:45:14.965Z\u0022\n}","repoMdFile":"E:\\work\\hub\\docs\\wiki\\repos.md","body.incidentId":752886997,"rcaFile":"","metadataFile":"","body.serviceName":"","discussionFile":"","mitigationStepsFile":"","body.teamName":"","rootRepoFolder":"E:\\work","incidentId":0,"queryLoopCount":0,"applicableTsgFile":"","incidentFolder":"E:\\icms\\Azure_Capacity_Infrastructure_Service\\NewDC_NewRegion\\752886997\\","etwEventsFile":"","summaryFile.md":"","queryScore":0,"issueListFile":""}}}
